# External artifacts

The recipe tool downloads and builds llama.cpp from a pinned public revision. llama.cpp is MIT licensed. Its LICENSE is retained in the generated runtime archive. Source: https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp.

Model weights are external downloads and are not distributed in this repository. Each recipe folder has a NOTICE for its model terms.

NVIDIA container images retain their upstream terms. Access to a public image reference does not grant credentials or image redistribution rights. No third-party runtime binaries, images or model weights are embedded in this tool.

The monitoring profile runs these external images:

- OpenTelemetry Collector Contrib 0.160.0, Apache-2.0: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector-contrib/tree/v0.160.0.
- VictoriaMetrics 1.153.0 community edition, Apache-2.0: https://github.com/VictoriaMetrics/VictoriaMetrics/tree/v1.153.0.
- Grafana OSS 13.2.3, AGPL-3.0: https://github.com/grafana/grafana/tree/v13.2.3. AGPL-3.0 is outside this repository's license allowlist. Downstream product use and redistribution require license review. This recipe does not establish that approval.

Images are fetched separately and retain their upstream licenses and notices. The repository contains deployment configuration and an original dashboard, not third-party binaries or modified Grafana code. Offline image redistribution must retain the applicable upstream materials.

Monitoring chart tests use PyYAML 6.0.3, MIT: https://github.com/yaml/pyyaml/tree/6.0.3. It is a development dependency only.
